cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Algoritmi di approssimazione: dispense online con esercizi svolti"
abstract: >-
  The lecture notes of the Approximation Algorithms course — performance ratio
  and guarantees, tight instances, approximation schemes (PTAS, FPTAS),
  algorithms for knapsack, bin packing, the metric TSP and parallel machine
  scheduling, limits of approximation for vertex coloring, maximum clique and
  the general TSP — with definitions, theorems and proofs, worked examples,
  exercises with solutions, slides, Colab notebooks and interactive apps.
authors:
